{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_title", "source_sha256": "4835c9d888524129f7ee11579bc19377e2e5cbe0d489242c330f2207d022649d", "ja": "そんな私でいたいから", "zh": "因为我想做这样的自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_synopsis", "source_sha256": "abe02b13243d82b662646b30e4ee32df5981822db861929431117388b8b79456", "ja": "仕事での失敗を機に両親からアイドルを辞め\nるよう勧められた可憐は、自分がアイドルで\nいたいと思う理由を探し始め、やがて自分を\n心配する他のアイドル達の言動の中に、自分\nの中にもある答えを見出すのだった。", "zh": "可怜因为工作上的失误而被父母劝说放弃做\n偶像，于是她开始寻找自己想继续当偶像的\n理由，并最终在关心自己的其他偶像们的一言\n一行中，找到了自己心中本就拥有的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ed87b740afe329f2d64efac6b8c646ba47437c50a6d673ff34d09a05b599a094", "ja": "―　篠宮家・リビング　―", "zh": "―　筱宫家·客厅　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "b4274a0e22a1bdf70972bdbdef18165b54393ba1a1552fc8d778d8cc593b60ac", "ja": "はぁ……。やっぱり、やめたほうが、\nよかったのかな……。はぁぁ……。", "zh": "唉……果然还是放弃比较好吧……。唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1002_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "97daac3129d7a04dfa4cf830f4a846dc77b7c024f15d3c02693f896bb8049442", "ja": "どうしたんだい、可憐？\nさっきから、ため息ばかりだね。", "zh": "怎么了，可怜？\n从刚才开始就一直在叹气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1003_karennmama", "source_sha256": "565d98d99b06b7be5872f01f5ec860409776b61e0ed55aa7e996adba3c22e5fc", "ja": "甘いものでも食べる？　マカロン？　ケーキにする？\nそうだわ、先にハーブティー淹れましょうか♪", "zh": "要不要吃点甜食？马卡龙？还是吃蛋糕？\n对了，我们先泡杯花草茶吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "14e07c07f480a0c2f3b73ad1a70aa60d8782f19b592da5bf557863e9ed9b2fab", "ja": "お父さん、お母さん……。\nあ……あのね、私……。", "zh": "爸爸、妈妈……  \n啊……那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "224fabb8c6b00b2f5c7c96e1a74f93d5db46c1f0948a545542a1070cc7daaa75", "ja": "今日のお仕事で、失敗しちゃったの……。\n私のせいで、撮影が……止まっちゃって……。", "zh": "今天的工作中，我搞砸了……  \n因为我的缘故，拍摄……停下来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "6aca9c5876fbe15332eadffe13a88bb191766e04d9b6c4370bbf2ff6deed863a", "ja": "みんなにも、{$P$}さんにも、\nたくさん迷惑かけちゃって……。あうう。", "zh": "给大家，还有{$P$}先生，\n添了好多麻烦……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1007_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "8fd4403c88f1c5f640dff6e443acb6f720185e97be4a48a9f2bc33d4ece5aaa8", "ja": "そうかそうか、それは残念だったね。でも気に病むこと\nはないさ。失敗は成功のもとっていうじゃないか。", "zh": "这样啊，这样啊，那还真是遗憾。不过不用为此\n太过烦恼。不是有句话说，失败乃成功之母吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1008_karennmama", "source_sha256": "fe1f8ace3ae2ad02b47a8583f0db9db1781a2a3c70bc36c76201d85e8662aca9", "ja": "そうそう、失敗する可憐も可愛いから大丈夫よ。\n今日のことは忘れて、次にいかなくっちゃ♪", "zh": "对对，连失败时的可怜也很可爱，所以没关系哦。  \n忘掉今天的事，得继续向前才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "2e8ce36762e41158e0b2f76cf6cac7032215effc089353c852e41046d4d383be", "ja": "で、でもね。みんなは、最初から心配してくれてて……\n無理しなくていいよって、言ってくれてたの。", "zh": "可、可是……大家从一开始就在替我担心……\n还一直对我说，不用勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "db31c59294e2ef28a391b65440670a352e7465a151c49d57da7d9a141a73cc82", "ja": "なのに、私が挑戦したいからって……\nアイドルとして、期待に応えたい、なんて言って。", "zh": "可是，我却因为自己想挑战……\n还说什么作为偶像，想要回应大家的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "f1b9ce6c5c76d057dbc0c7f5a3f9031ff34913c0bfd993a5dad9f8fcb29b77ef", "ja": "なのに、いざとなったら全然ダメで……。\n乗り物に乗る前に、気絶しちゃって……。はぁ……。", "zh": "可是事到临头却完全不行……  \n还没坐上交通工具就先晕过去了……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1012_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "e136618017f13c7d53b1adb7f8644ef31177a16ce0330b75e90cb939bc3d774a", "ja": "そうかそうか。そんな難しいことに挑戦するなんて、\nえらいぞ可憐。パパは誇らしいよ！", "zh": "这样啊，这样啊。居然要挑战那么困难的事情，真了不起，可怜。爸爸为你感到骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "666ad1fa2185a1caa1465f43b6d7b1c24c039f34fd50c81a89da06d0e7ce6bd3", "ja": "ぜ、全然難しくないんだよっ。ただ、世界一高くて速い\nジェットコースターに、乗るだけだったのに……。", "zh": "一、一点都不难啦。只是要坐上世界上最高、最快的过山车而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1014_karennpapamama", "source_sha256": "eef69907253279d848c917fb98fd053e7ebe6bffa242ff41b8d16b0474f368bb", "ja": "世界一ぃぃ！？！？！？！？！？？？", "zh": "世界第一！？！？！？！？！？？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1015_karennmama", "source_sha256": "0cb4b7c5d44a5286577d82c78ade962fea0ec1be2b4b4718b3f4142a1001becc", "ja": "そ、それには乗らなかったのよね！？　よかったぁ～！\nだって、世界一危ないってことでしょう！？", "zh": "我、我没坐那个吧！？太好了～！\n因为那可是世界上最危险的东西，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "8a3d9f0bbba09678b81db37804aa3904f7942fe5b40300d801aa6ca4865985b9", "ja": "え？　そ、そういうことじゃ、無いと思うけど……？", "zh": "诶？我、我觉得不是那回事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1017_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "5abc8293095fd754d2133cc5e634c1f622b6179606f806382fd5e62e3052ffee", "ja": "よしよし、怖い思いをさせてごめんね。\nパパ、アイドルのことを全然わかってなかったよ……。", "zh": "好啦好啦，对不起，让你受惊了。\n爸爸完全不了解偶像啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1018_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "75592998f3b4ab1474c60d3fb7d6d8d6d49abaf61bbd1b4facd8ef05ac1824ea", "ja": "でも、話してくれたおかげでよくわかった。\nそういうことなら……、可憐。", "zh": "不过，多亏你告诉了我，我明白了。\n既然是这样……可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1019_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "bbea7bbbb94cfc8fbb17129a5bf4f816de40762276e4c4010e95646dff13ef48", "ja": "アイドル、辞めたほうがいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "是不是该放弃偶像活动比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "d5b46bd9649b823a8b64488c29fe469c38be176f62d2b61b73f3e35e211f0633", "ja": "？　……、えっ？", "zh": "？……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1021_karennmama", "source_sha256": "c93035105045d45bbbad41e48191d925c189a976be3392ba872b694bccbd9d7b", "ja": "そうね、アイドルしてる可憐は、とっっっても\n可愛いから残念だけど。辞めちゃいましょう！", "zh": "是啊，当偶像的可怜明明超级超级可爱，虽然很遗憾。\n还是辞掉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "a6022d8ffc5973f40540fe417d20c50390f915671685cc305e334d75e151b944", "ja": "えええっ！？　ど、どうして……？", "zh": "诶诶诶！？为、为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1023_karennmama", "source_sha256": "5015ccef6da672289a761e51592bd2b7cce35e491215b82ab52b1651365ac655", "ja": "だって、危ないお仕事でケガでもしたら大変でしょう？\nそんなことになったら、ママが気絶しちゃうもの。", "zh": "毕竟要是在危险的工作中受了伤，可就糟糕了，对吧？\n真变成那样的话，妈妈会晕过去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1024_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "5e088fc8afa3180faf36fbf05fcce3ac95ec460213c59df5fe38437281627ce5", "ja": "そうそう、小さい頃みたいにね。\nあの頃の可憐は、やんちゃで大変だったなぁ。", "zh": "对，就像小时候那样。\n那时候的可怜很调皮，真让人费心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1025_karennmama", "source_sha256": "13b94c31bd639509b4304ab88af4b1eca5ed8f7554ec9fac9ea2082be9302c0d", "ja": "危ないことや怖いことをぜ～んぶ遠ざけて、とっても\nお淑やかになれたのよね♪　……思った以上に♪", "zh": "把危险和可怕的事情全～都赶走后，就变得特别端庄了呢♪……比想象中还要端庄♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "ed97ca25ad549360f65a4f8d96ce8d7036a18299994549f766686dfffd5b0146", "ja": "ま、待って！　そ、そういうことじゃなくて……！", "zh": "等、等一下！不、不是那个意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1027_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "64857b9c457ab332958664298b0c6cd07fccc96e1fecd2bb0f409589362ef9fb", "ja": "大丈夫。途中で辞めるのは気まずいだろうけど、\n無理に続けるものでもないからね。", "zh": "没事的。中途放弃确实会觉得不好意思，\n但也没必要勉强继续下去呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "2f002e0ee0fb78ad005ae656c9494eb337c4e3307e25ec9ed1eb2de982fb3da2", "ja": "む、無理とかじゃ、ないよぉ……！\n私は、臆病を直したくて……、だから……！", "zh": "不、不是勉强……！\n我是想改掉胆小……所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1029_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "f0a755b8e43b1b5a79a78d0866323cabc9cdb868c8b4a18f0a8ebf61fd212438", "ja": "うんうんわかってる、パパも応援してるよ。\nでも臆病を直すなら、アイドルじゃなくてもいいよね？", "zh": "嗯嗯，我知道，爸爸也在为你加油哦。\n不过，如果是为了克服胆小，不当偶像也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1030_karennmama", "source_sha256": "ba3db0692c0e570a6f72f1eea1741778debb02cc61dc60782160cf42a5b0bfd6", "ja": "バレエとかダンスとか、ピアノとかお琴とか。\nあっ、ママと一緒にお料理教室なんてどうかしら♪", "zh": "芭蕾、舞蹈，还有钢琴、古筝之类的。\n啊，和妈妈一起去上烹饪课怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "797f7a6c715997944c78656f0e354ede7409b131f5171647de76776fd142906b", "ja": "う……っ、や……っ。", "zh": "呜……不……要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "b4d441900094abda12e7c030750659dcb425d914baeeb59063d475958941a773", "ja": "や～～だ～～っ！　私は、アイドルがいいのぉ～～っ！\nふぇぇえええん！", "zh": "不～～要～～！我就是想当偶像嘛～～！\n哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1033_karennpapamama", "source_sha256": "2d9884aa1c218bd3f658b3ec28c4e649b09a676599215a119325874cd4ce395c", "ja": "あわわわわっ！！　か、可憐ちゃんっ！？", "zh": "啊哇哇哇哇！！可、可怜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
