{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "77860216e5559503c3802c2680851013689f7fc68b33c72ccd64f13fe5b91949", "ja": "どうして……なのかな……？", "zh": "为什么……会这样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1042_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1043_011ami", "source_sha256": "674e79615a9fc22bb173a874348419dd53c103d85cc0d12e28eddbea9ad5d0e7", "ja": "というわけで！　ゲロっちまいな、しのみやん！\nもうネタはあがってるんだぜ！　カリッカリだぜ！", "zh": "所以说！老老实实招了吧，四宫！\n我们已经掌握证据了！证据确凿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1044_045kar", "source_sha256": "f4b736d43c8cf3009d51c6189fbd6d28221658772de5573e569bd546d514283a", "ja": "あうぅ。\nい、いきなり、なんのこと、亜美ちゃん？", "zh": "啊呜……\n突、突然的，这是怎么回事，亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1045_040tam", "source_sha256": "c7a228ece69959724b22b34e1909880dbe58fb69a5b79302e1ba843da5c8983f", "ja": "あみ～。可憐お姉ちゃん、びっくりしてるぞ？", "zh": "阿美～。可怜姐姐被吓到了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1046_011ami", "source_sha256": "3cc70df82f4ce495b6867c9d5c9ba815182dba53187a921ea83c4dfaf2453af7", "ja": "おっと、それなら出血大サービスだ！\nたまきち刑事（デカ）、カツ丼を出してやんな！", "zh": "哎呀，既然这样，那就来个大放送！\n环酱刑警，给她端上猪排盖饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1047_040tam", "source_sha256": "891df7362d873a692db0d5a38b1dce965098e5ee2ed7407f7c4fb4dcbb9badc0", "ja": "うんっ！　カツ丼味のお菓子、\nいっぱいあるから食べてね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！有好多猪排盖饭味的零食，尽管吃吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "974d9d8037d0029743723f138378c1b9ae1f8521c2637731e17bd9538515b987", "ja": "私はお茶を淹れてきたの。ハーブと煎茶のブレンド、\n可憐ちゃんのお口に合うといいんだけど……。", "zh": "我泡了茶带过来。是香草和煎茶的混合茶，\n希望可怜能喜欢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "e4d257d8fc638835167c82cb946216eb8cbcff87fb0ca2f7e431938d84e53869", "ja": "あたしは、お漬物を持ってきたよぉ。\n実家から届いたばかりで、歯ごたえもバッチリだべさ♪", "zh": "我带了腌菜来哦。刚从老家寄到的，口感脆生生的，特别棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1050_011ami", "source_sha256": "acb75e4b68f4c773a4855858e7ec33abbb2960fbf2689c7012028bcda1c12e58", "ja": "そして最後は、亜美の秘密兵器！\nてやーっ！　アロマ・ディフ……、ディフなんとかー！", "zh": "然后最后是，亚美的秘密武器！嘿呀——！香薰扩……扩散器什么的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "5f9d2f0b58261c2588fd626078eec9f403d367fb89a910ac1948d7bd128e6d8d", "ja": "ふふっ、アロマディフューザーだね……。\nあ、なんだか律子さんのに似てる……。", "zh": "呵呵，是香薰机呢……  \n啊，总觉得和律子小姐的很像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1052_011ami", "source_sha256": "ce9f2775c301b332735fc8067d8ccd599bb6c18d0d6c093b199195177fe9ccf4", "ja": "大正解～♪　律っちゃんに借りてきたんだー。\nしのみやんの好きな香りもあるんだって！", "zh": "完全正确～♪　是向律子借来的哦——\n听说也有筱宫宫喜欢的香味呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "a9121ff045c9b5f5404e471fae969205627d4060f126bf43609ec912324cff76", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。でも、あの……、\nどうして会議室に来たの？　今日のレッスンは……？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……不过，那个……\n为什么来会议室了？今天的练习……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1054_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d713b6fd7e5f83dcb1abd40885ffce547a47e8ad2898f438441849a7ab94c8c4", "ja": "あのね、今日のレッスンは中止になったの。\nだから、みんなでお茶会にしようって。", "zh": "那个，今天的练习取消了。\n所以大家想一起开茶会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1055_045kar", "source_sha256": "afd21ab539a239bf3eef86e65a5eb6031ba4db6d8ecec82cf11ae4779eb04e60", "ja": "中止……？\nで、でも私たち、もうすぐ公演なのに……。はっ！", "zh": "取消……？\n可、可是我们马上就要公演了……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1056_karennpapa", "source_sha256": "97286a153c16a16e38521f62026265ca56306ca8336002002431ee825ba4f1ae", "ja": "『アイドル、辞めたほうがいいんじゃないかな？』", "zh": "“是不是别当偶像比较好呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1057_045kar", "source_sha256": "dc0258ecca06e0492844b835e34c7e5c7a429804c89e2ee412a633976ea6a1c4", "ja": "ま、まさか、公演もやめちゃうの！？", "zh": "难、难道连公演也要停掉吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1058_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3f6289a85c57fec6f686a08bafc172d67f2ba8ef9404f4fa98cb2fbc7d2f4657", "ja": "あわわ、違うよ！　可憐ちゃん、最近ちょっと\n元気ないみたいだったから、気分転換にって。", "zh": "啊，才不是呢！因为可怜最近好像有点没精神，所以想让她换换心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1059_040tam", "source_sha256": "ce7ac71b00840398965a89db743418d8b86b9bd963b4e27be7e93dba730d6cc3", "ja": "おやぶんがね、今日はみんなで思いっきり\n遊んでいいって言ってくれたんだ～♪", "zh": "大叔说了，今天可以和大家尽情玩个痛快～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1060_045kar", "source_sha256": "098925b10871712d4d56307d8c41764c247f0381ce7d54d7e86e9de8f8997606", "ja": "{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生说的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1061_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6e9a8b832b9763390774111408c21c60a85addebb6871fc6266833399502b12", "ja": "気分が乗らない時は、パーッと遊ぶに限るかんね♪\nアロマ大会でもいいよ！　なんかチョーゴーとかする？", "zh": "没心情的时候，就该痛痛快快玩一场♪\n举办香味大赛也可以哦！要不要调配点什么超棒的香味？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1062_035hin", "source_sha256": "f6870da94533175591efaea939feb2cf4d5cc64bdc69ce0c9b8bf2db43877b07", "ja": "みんなでいろんな香りを作るのも、楽しそうだねぇ。\n可憐さん、教えてくれるかい？", "zh": "大家一起调配各种香味，好像也挺好玩的呢。\n可怜小姐，你能教教我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1063_045kar", "source_sha256": "3d193a2e5b802c4f833fa1725925fa933a3275189b51059a1bb3f1cb1bf00476", "ja": "あ……う、うん！\nそれじゃあ……、ちょっと待っててね……♪", "zh": "啊……嗯、嗯！\n那么……稍微等我一下哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1065_045kar", "source_sha256": "2252b48231156b24a55d65db67642a50c3a3a4a7804abd1a9ae9172554bc9866", "ja": "あ、あのぅ……。{$P$}さん？", "zh": "那、那个……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1066_p", "source_sha256": "700120bc7dce294d5ccb79ae4adcb3267576ab85e35ef043ad96daca6b240673", "ja": "ああ、可憐、お疲れさま。\n雪歩たちとのお茶会は終わったのか？", "zh": "啊，可怜，辛苦了。\n和雪步她们的茶会结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1067_045kar", "source_sha256": "b2b5f91f04fb9ce97c314f00dd8268707cdf56c26a704afda95e5348624c8091", "ja": "は、はい……。とっても個性的なアロマを、\nたくさん作れました……えへへ♪", "zh": "是、是……我们做出了好多香味非常独特的香薰……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1068_p", "source_sha256": "91fb185bdd20a4767d412ebe8f7259b66fce611ebd8df55bc3c4c181734605fd", "ja": "どうりで、いい匂いがすると思ったよ。\nちゃんと気分転換ができたみたいで、よかった。", "zh": "难怪我觉得闻起来很香呢。\n看来你确实好好转换了心情，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1069_045kar", "source_sha256": "b0e9ebd487e0f6cf508c25bc5c1076230cddfc94cdd9e0f3ae7572e6d34b4089", "ja": "あっ。そのことで、お詫びに来たんでした……。", "zh": "啊。我就是为了这件事，才来向您道歉的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1070_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d0e6f83a058e86db9c98a1aecb12cd2cec26d78361a9e62cddc0454562d03d0", "ja": "公演前の大事な時期なのに、レッスン、お休みに\nしてもらっちゃって……すみません……。", "zh": "明明是演出前这么重要的时期，却还让您把课程停下来……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1071_045kar", "source_sha256": "89760771de41392012d8a008f158a5ccb95a64381e2180e79f42be5261187803", "ja": "だ、ダメですよね……？　私、アイドルなのに。\nお仕事もレッスンも、ちゃんとできないなんて……。", "zh": "不、不行吧……？明明是偶像，却连工作和训练都做不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1072_045kar", "source_sha256": "0768041c486679e31e652b58d9eba0b871e6335441156d9b08c93648fd744f0e", "ja": "こ、こんな、中途半端だから……。\nお父さんにも、あんなこと……。", "zh": "因、因为总是这样半途而废……  \n连爸爸也说了那种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1073_p", "source_sha256": "2160b8bac5601b92645676e0eafe595c91ddb07fcc9db2d45112cb1e748d1a03", "ja": "うん？　ご両親と、何か話したのか？", "zh": "嗯？你和父母谈了些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1074_045kar", "source_sha256": "a31c3c27fe25c1c25b77569c834c745d678bf98634a97bfbba730df9bb51146c", "ja": "ああっ、いえ！　あの、ええっと、違うんですっ！\nわ、私、辞めたくなんかなくってぇ……！", "zh": "啊，不是！那个，呃，不是这样的！  \n我、我才不想放弃呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1075_p", "source_sha256": "ad1e994e8f07d7ed7b72b96940edc4373b4cbdb7f719ea2de4434e662874ca9b", "ja": "……。\nよかったら、話を聞かせてくれないかな。", "zh": "……。\n可以的话，能跟我聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1076_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1077_p", "source_sha256": "6cd7e47970a632decb7e35e35aace0f1cfe05877eb07303014c6549af80260ef", "ja": "……なるほど。自分がどうしてアイドルで\nいたいのか、わからなくなってたんだな。", "zh": "……原来是这样。你不知道自己为什么想要当偶像了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1078_045kar", "source_sha256": "1766125d75b6244ab79791d02f1a47fd3b149f6793ac5536b4c4bc0ce2f744d9", "ja": "は、はい……。そんな私なのに、\n今日のレッスンも飛ばしちゃって……。", "zh": "是、是的……明明是这样的我，今天的课程也没去上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1079_p", "source_sha256": "c29ee9d8af7c1515931326936504ac5b1573b3320baa6dd5820086c476df39ba", "ja": "可憐は謝らなくていいよ。レッスンのことなら、\n中止を言い出したのは、そのアイドルたちだ。", "zh": "可怜不用道歉的。至于练习的事，\n先提出来要中止的，正是那些偶像们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1080_045kar", "source_sha256": "f08e6d0c56cc3d88c63115ccf0e170f49d450cdf5f5c968cbea076b73ed8a118", "ja": "え……？　アイドルたち……？", "zh": "诶……？偶像们……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1081_p", "source_sha256": "4a6f3913cfa6b59b5d58ae87a1f40229578d9864c7bad9390c2cd44db0d543bc", "ja": "雪歩と亜美、ひなたと環が直談判に来たんだよ。\n今は遊びこそ最高のレッスンだよ、とか言ってたっけ。", "zh": "雪步、亚美、日向和环来直接谈判了。她们好像还说了什么“现在正是玩耍才是最好的练习”之类的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1082_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff1904e6515aacef919fe4f6dac56d78c11984ae02bd7b753c16a1952f4488f1", "ja": "みんなが……！\nそ、そうだったんですか……。", "zh": "大家……！\n是、是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1083_p", "source_sha256": "3a1357ae509987b09e0496e8da9eb6d6c3279ecfde42e84b0d303d36fcf55cc2", "ja": "おかげで可憐はちょっと元気になったみたいだし。\n正解だったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "多亏了大家，可怜好像也稍微打起精神来了。\n我觉得这应该是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1084_045kar", "source_sha256": "c0a6595fce02fcdb3e8a083b1794336c22b7b1c4ccadb83c24f17d1010e47364", "ja": "で、でも……どうして、なんでしょう……。\n遊園地のお仕事も、私のせいで、失敗したのに。", "zh": "可是、可是……为什么会这样呢……。\n游乐园的工作明明也因为我而搞砸了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1085_045kar", "source_sha256": "8ae3bb178a5bc2c7f83bd3d2540bc0f570ad012b4f572343e228bd9efefcda63", "ja": "なのにみんな、優しくて……励ましてくれて。\n今日もいっぱい、寄り添って、くれ……て……？", "zh": "可大家却都对我这么温柔……还鼓励我。今天也一直陪在我身边……还……为我做了这么多……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1086_p", "source_sha256": "17b352c2bbea2c46bd56d5adf89ba89c25dbaba64504859ad6ab43357ad51fd2", "ja": "うん。可憐がみんなの立場でも、同じことをしてくれた\nだろうな。今までもずっと、そうしてくれてたし。", "zh": "嗯。要是可怜处在大家的位置上，也一定会做同样的事吧。毕竟一直以来，她都这么支持着大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1087_045kar", "source_sha256": "95a6cce81cf0d912a8d987ebc693c7b88dc05c15b60de570528a94dac9ec8c5c", "ja": "……。私も……。", "zh": "……。我也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1088_p", "source_sha256": "585b0a0db021e8f136225d215f2c98919a5ffc9403417414ae8c25c167c7932c", "ja": "仲間だからとか、気持ちがわかるとか、笑顔がみたい\nとか。理由はいろいろあるんだろうけど……。", "zh": "也许是因为是伙伴，也许是因为想理解彼此的心情，也许是因为想看到笑容……理由应该有很多吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1089_p", "source_sha256": "4126be6b1d768a49f22343a8c5615e6c2e4d4ce9dd6963fd79f7148c8a4c6b26", "ja": "結局、みんな『アイドル』だからだと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得说到底，大家都是因为身为“偶像”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1090_045kar", "source_sha256": "e65531201a6a964b035ff6f3cb897e9da7c8f8ae4f742ec899160b7359e3a34b", "ja": "アイドル、だから……？", "zh": "因为是偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1091_p", "source_sha256": "96009e1bb6539186419c6d65ee12572d1f2a7a81ccb3f044cf5e20ef2fb9de03", "ja": "観客やファンにはもちろん、仲間にも友達にも。\n両親にも家族にも、きっと周りの人全部に。", "zh": "对观众和粉丝自不用说，对伙伴、对朋友，\n对父母、对家人，想必对身边所有人都是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1092_p", "source_sha256": "04445b0ab616317b6f7307711776771ca24a24232dfbb7e05fc346473499cebf", "ja": "アイドルは元気を、希望を、勇気を与えてくれる。\nその輝きや笑顔、優しさで。", "zh": "偶像会用活力、希望和勇气带给大家。\n用那份光芒、笑容与温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1093_p", "source_sha256": "ee64acaae80fb0c3acd581e6e402fc23e73a8deb01452cd469fa2f20bc71cc72", "ja": "その素晴らしさを一番よく知ってるのも、\nきっとアイドルだ。……可憐みたいにな！", "zh": "最了解那份美好的，也一定是偶像……就像可怜一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1094_045kar", "source_sha256": "7f293a6d943fd06ffa43506828f2cd3a2047551c40ec4ce6359e96796e00daff", "ja": "……！　は、はい……。はいっ、知ってます。\nアイドルの……、みんなの、素敵なところ……。", "zh": "……！　是、是的……。是的，我知道。\n偶像的……大家的优点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1095_045kar", "source_sha256": "b79938998c836e43807cc1bce2b823c3ba8024663006e78bfc8095fe4af51097", "ja": "勇気を、もらうんじゃなくて……誰かに、あげられる。\n……私も、そんな風でいたい……。だから……。", "zh": "不是从别人那里得到勇气……而是把勇气给予别人。\n……我也想成为那样的人……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_153_1096_045kar", "source_sha256": "92f0fc823cc02c5e1f5d24b9fa5f65d1b07cea5ff1c798fa0c1a61dcd06d7f40", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n私、これからもずっと、アイドルでいたいです……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我今后也想一直当偶像……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
